 *     bulk-import script blocking this long is worse than finishing a smaller
 *     real slice and reporting exactly what it deferred, which is what
 *     `--apply` runs of this script do (see FINAL SUMMARY's "deferred"
 *     lines). Re-run later (ideally with a token — see GITHUB_TOKEN below)
 *     to pick up where it left off; it is idempotent, so partial coverage is
 *     never partial correctness.
